      "title": "Propagação sem parâmetro",
      "items": [
        "AsyncLocalStorage<AuditContext> em singleton module-level",
        "buildContext() extrai span ativa via trace.getSpan(context.active())",
        "correlationId = w3cTraceId ?? randomUUID() (fallback)",
        "AuditContextStore.run(ctx, fn) cria scope; get() puxa do scope",
        "PrismaAuditService.record() recebe ctx via get() no momento do log"
